<!DOCTYPE html>
	<html lang="en">
	<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" 
	content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>The famine in Mungundo</title>
	
	<style type="text/css">
	h1{
	background:conic-gradient(#0A70FA,#6000A5);
	border-radius:15px;
	padding:15px;
	}
	body{
	background:linear-gradient(to right, grey,silver);
	}
	#img1{
	border:3px double white;
	border-radius:100%;
	animation-name:poping;
	animation-duration:20s;
	animation-iteration-count:infinite;

	}
	img{
	border:2px solid aquamarine;
	border-radius:10px;
	}
	a{
	text-decoration:none;
	color:gold;
	font-weight:600;
	}
	button{
	padding:15px;
	background-color:blue;
	border-radius:15px;
	}
	@keyframes poping{
	0%{transform:scale(1)}
	50%{transform:scale(0.8)}
	100%{transform:scale(1)}
	0%{background-color:blue}
	50%{background-color:black}
	100%{background-color:blue}
	}
	button{
	animation-name:poping;
	animation-duration:3s;
	animation-iteration-count:infinite;
	}
	
	</style>
	</head>
	<body>
	<h1>The famine in Mungundo</h1>
	<img id="img1"src="dr.jpg" width="100%">
	<p id="p1">&nbsp;&nbsp;Once upon a time, 
	there lived a tortoise in the land of 
	Munguda, his name Kamfor. Kamfor was 
	popularly known for his greed and 
	selfishness, which the whole commmunity 
	think that this kind of behaviour 
	shouldn't be coming from Kamfor because 
	of his situation of sluggishness and 
	slowliness.</p>
	<img src="lseftad.jpg" width="100%">
	
	<p id="p2">&nbsp;&nbsp;Kamfor had a 
	friend who is a dog,  
	his name is Mopoh. Unlike Kamfor, Mopoh 
	is a wise, fast and a smart person, 
	though he is not perfectly moral, yet, 
	his widom and decency still outbeat 
	that of Kamfor the Tortoise.</p>
	
	<p id="p3">&nbsp;&nbsp;There came a 
	season in the village of Munguda when
	neither rain nor dew fall, as a result of 
	this, there was a draught which led to a 
	great famine in the land. At this time ,
	everybody even including Lion the king were 
	been striken with serious hunger and poverty.
	</p>
	
	<img src="hl.jpg" width="100%"><br>
